#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:6
msgid "Training with an RL Agent"
msgstr "与 RL Agent 进行训练"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:10
msgid ""
"Train a Stable-Baselines3 policy to balance Cartpole using the task from "
":ref:`tutorial-register-rl-env-gym`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`tutorial-register-rl-env-gym` 中的任务，训练 Stable-Baselines3 策略来平衡 "
"Cartpole。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:13
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab environments return batched PyTorch tensors, while each RL library"
" expects its own environment interface. The wrappers in :mod:`isaaclab_rl` "
"adapt observations, actions, and episode information to that interface. This"
" tutorial uses the Stable-Baselines3 ``VecEnv`` wrapper; see :ref:`how-to-"
"env-wrappers` for the other wrappers and :ref:`reinforcement-learning` for "
"the training command reference."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 环境返回批量 PyTorch 张量，各强化学习库则要求各自的环境接口。:mod:`isaaclab_rl` "
"中的包装器将观测、动作和回合信息适配为相应接口。本教程使用 Stable-Baselines3 的 ``VecEnv`` 包装器；其他包装器见 "
":ref:`how-to-env-wrappers`，训练命令参考见 :ref:`reinforcement-learning`。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:21
msgid ""
"Apply Gymnasium wrappers before the Isaac Lab wrapper for your RL library. "
"The RL wrapper changes the environment interface and may no longer support "
"Gymnasium wrappers."
msgstr ""
"Gymnasium 包装器应先于所用强化学习库的 Isaac Lab 包装器应用。RL 包装器会改变环境接口，之后可能不再支持 Gymnasium "
"包装器。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:26
msgid "The Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:28
msgid ""
"For this tutorial, we use the training implementation from `Stable-"
"Baselines3`_ workflow in the ``isaaclab_rl.entrypoints.backends.train_sb3`` "
"module."
msgstr ""
"本教程使用 `Stable-Baselines3`_ 工作流的训练实现，位于 "
"``isaaclab_rl.entrypoints.backends.train_sb3`` 模块。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:0
msgid "Code for train_sb3.py"
msgstr "train_sb3.py 代码"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:40
msgid "The Code Explained"
msgstr "代码解释"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:44
msgid ""
"Most of the code above is boilerplate code to create logging directories, "
"saving the parsed configurations, and setting up different Stable-Baselines3"
" components. For this tutorial, the important part is creating the "
"environment and wrapping it with the Stable-Baselines3 wrapper."
msgstr ""
"上面的大部分代码是创建日志目录、保存解析的配置和设置不同的 Stable-Baselines3 组件的样板代码。对于本教程，重要的部分是创建环境并使用 "
"Stable-Baselines3 包装器对其进行包装。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:48
msgid "There are three wrappers used in the code above:"
msgstr "代码中使用了三个包装器: "

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:50
msgid ""
":class:`gymnasium.wrappers.RecordVideo`: This wrapper records a video of the"
" environment and saves it to the specified directory. This is useful for "
"visualizing the agent's behavior during training."
msgstr ""
":class:`gymnasium.wrappers.RecordVideo`: 这个包装器记录环境的视频并将其保存到指定目录。这对于在训练过程中可视化"
" agent 的行为非常有用。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:53
msgid ""
":class:`wrappers.sb3.Sb3VecEnvWrapper`: This wrapper converts the "
"environment into a Stable-Baselines3 compatible environment."
msgstr ""
":class:`wrappers.sb3.Sb3VecEnvWrapper`: 这个包装器将环境转换为 Stable-Baselines3 兼容的环境。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:55
msgid ""
"`stable_baselines3.common.vec_env.VecNormalize`_: This wrapper normalizes "
"the environment's observations and rewards."
msgstr ""
"`stable_baselines3.common.vec_env.VecNormalize`_: 这个包装器对环境的观测和奖励进行标准化。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:58
msgid ""
"Each of these wrappers wrap around the previous wrapper by following ``env ="
" wrapper(env, *args, **kwargs)`` repeatedly. The final environment is then "
"used to train the agent. For more information on how these wrappers work, "
"please refer to the :ref:`how-to-env-wrappers` documentation."
msgstr ""
"这些包装器中的每一个都通过反复执行 ``env = wrapper(env, *args, **kwargs)`` "
"来包装前一个包装器。然后使用最终的环境来训练 agent。有关这些包装器如何工作的更多信息，请参考 :ref:`how-to-env-wrappers`"
" 文档。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:63
msgid "The Code Execution"
msgstr "代码执行"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:65
msgid ""
"We train a PPO agent from Stable-Baselines3 to solve the cartpole balancing "
"task."
msgstr "我们训练一个从 Stable-Baselines3 学习的 PPO agent 来解决 cartpole 平衡任务。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:68
msgid "Training the agent"
msgstr "训练 agent"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:70
msgid ""
"Train without a visualizer, watch the simulation live, or record a video "
"using the options below."
msgstr "通过以下选项，可无可视化器训练、实时观察仿真或录制视频。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:74
msgid "Headless execution"
msgstr "无界面执行"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:76
msgid ""
"When no visualizer is requested, no interactive visualizer window is opened "
"during training. This is useful when training on a remote server or when you"
" do not need live visual feedback, which can add some compute cost. "
"Rendering can still be active for sensor/camera data capture when enabled by"
" the workflow."
msgstr ""
"未请求可视化器时，训练期间不会打开交互式可视化窗口。这适用于远程服务器训练，或不需要实时画面反馈的情况，因为实时反馈会增加一些计算开销。工作流启用传感器或相机数据采集后，渲染仍可保持运行。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:90
msgid "Headless execution with off-screen render"
msgstr "无界面执行与离屏渲染"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:92
msgid ""
"To inspect behavior from a training run without an interactive window, pass "
"``--video``. By default, it records the scene from a headless Newton GL "
"visualizer. See :doc:`/source/how-to/record_video` to choose a different "
"visualizer or a camera-sensor output."
msgstr ""
"若需在不打开交互窗口的情况下检查训练行为，请传入 ``--video``。默认从无窗口 Newton GL "
"可视化器录制场景。选择其他可视化器或相机传感器输出，见 :doc:`/source/how-to/record_video`。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:104
msgid ""
"The videos are saved to the ``logs/sb3/Isaac-Cartpole/<run-"
"dir>/videos/train`` directory. You can open these videos using any video "
"player."
msgstr ""
"视频保存在 ``logs/sb3/Isaac-Cartpole/<run-dir>/videos/train`` 目录，可以用任意视频播放器打开。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:107
msgid ""
"For tasks with on-scene cameras, you can also save the sensor image outputs "
"directly during training with ``--capture_env_sensors``. See "
":doc:`/source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames` for the available options and "
"output formats."
msgstr ""
"对于场景中带有相机的任务，还可以通过 ``--capture_env_sensors`` 在训练期间直接保存传感器图像输出。可用选项和输出格式见 "
":doc:`/source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames` 。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:112
msgid "Interactive execution"
msgstr "交互式执行"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:116
msgid ""
"While the above two methods are useful for training the agent, they don't "
"allow you to interact with the simulation to see what is happening. In this "
"case, run the training command as follows:"
msgstr "上述两种方式可用于训练智能体，但无法与仿真交互、观察实时情况。如果需要交互，可按以下方式运行训练命令："

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:128
msgid ""
"This will open the Kit visualizer window and you can see the agent training "
"in the environment. However, this can slow down the training process because"
" interactive visual feedback is enabled. As a workaround, you can switch "
"between different render modes in the ``\"Isaac Lab\"`` window that is "
"docked on the bottom-right corner of the screen. To learn more about these "
"render modes, please check the :class:`sim.SimulationContext.RenderMode` "
"class."
msgstr ""
"这会打开 Kit 可视化窗口，可以看到智能体在环境中训练。不过，启用交互式画面反馈可能降低训练速度。可以在屏幕右下角停靠的 ``\"Isaac "
"Lab\"`` 窗口中切换不同渲染模式。更多信息见 :class:`sim.SimulationContext.RenderMode` 。"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:135
msgid "Viewing the logs"
msgstr "查看日志"

#: source/how-to/run_rl_training.rst:137
msgid ""
"On a separate terminal, you can monitor the training progress by executing "
"the following command:"
msgstr "在单独的终端中，您可以通过执行以下命令监视训练进度: "

